Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:38:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: OpenLV widget

Add an OpenLV header widget with a popup to connect a dApp by its
openlv:// URL. Ported to @openlv/session 0.2 (webrtc() transport passed to
connectSession, JSON-RPC response envelope returned to the peer).

Co-authored-by: Luc <luc@lucemans.nl>
